        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Omugabe ku ariiha ekiconco omu buhunguzi bwe, yaakiha omwe aha batabani, kiryaba eky'abatabani; omu biragiro by'obuhunguzi n'ekyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
