          "text": " Kwonka ku ariiha ekiconco omu buhunguzi bwe, yaakiha omwe aha baheereza be, kiryaguma kiri ekye okuhitsya omu mwaka gw'obusingye, bwanyima kigarukire omugabe; abatabani bonka nibo bariikirizibwa kugama n'ekiconco ekirugire omu buhunguzi bwe. ",
