        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima yantwara omu kibuga ky'aheeru, yampitsya aha nshonda ina zaakyo; ahari buri nshonda hakaba hariho ekibuga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
