              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunda y'obwo bubuga bwona, hakaba hombekirwemu omushorongo okwehinguririza ogurimu emyanya y'okuteekyeramu embaju zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
